  "prefLabel": "Frl 602.01 Notification Obligations for Funeral Directors",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Frl 602.01 Notification Obligations for Funeral Directors.\n\n(a) A funeral director who changes the location of their funeral home, or who adds a funeral home away from their main or primary funeral home, or both, or who purchases a funeral home, shall notify the OPLC as required by Plc 307.02, and request an inspection.\n\n(b) Inspections shall proceed as required by Plc 403 and Plc 404.\n\nSource. #1689, eff 12-22-80; ss by#2344, eff 4-15-83; ss by #2986, eff 3-18-85; ss by #4357, eff 1-20-88, EXPIRED: 1-20-94\n\nNew. #10988, eff 12-7-15; ss by #14646, eff 9-4-26, EXPIRES: 9-4-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/frl100-900.html"
